I'm considering the requirement for singular metadata, like "文件名/元信息/大小分区." It could include mimeType and perhaps upload status, though the status has a separate line. I wonder if the `subtitle` should be the mimeType or in a format like "mimeType · assetId." It feels better to show mimeType directly, and if it’s absent, I could just display "Document." Additionally, we definitely want to include the title, size, and status. Good!
